  <title id="title">Asyno</title>
  <desc id="desc">Software developer in Esbjerg, Denmark. Building secure, local-first apps and the pipelines that ship them. A brass rune dial engraved with the 24 runes of the Elder Futhark turns and comes to rest on Ansuz, Odin's rune.</desc>
